# =========================================================================
# DOCUMENTATION / ARTIFACTS
# =========================================================================
# Ignore all markdown files (like AI artifacts, reports, etc.)
*.md
*.MD

# Also ignore the specific extension-less report files
GiftsNGifts_Report
GNGKAREPORT.md
GiftsNGifts_Platform.md

# Ignore root level images (chat artifacts)
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

# EXCEPT for essential documentation files
!README.md
!readme.md
!README.MD
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CODING_STANDARDS.md
